@startuml layer08_architecture_overview
title System Architecture Overview

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

' 外部参与者：UPP 提供需求和数据背景，学生团队配置并运行原型。
actor "UPP Analyst / Client" as UPP
actor "Student Team" as TEAM

' 架构总览：Layer 1 到 Layer 7 依次覆盖请求、编排、处理、建模、评估、治理和存储。
component "Layer 1:\nRequest Interface" as Layer1
component "Layer 2:\nPipeline Orchestration Layer" as Layer2
component "Layer 3:\nData Processing Pipeline" as Layer3
component "Layer 4:\nForecasting Methodology Layer" as Layer4
component "Layer 5:\nEvaluation, Explainability & Handover Layer" as Layer5
component "Layer 6:\nData Governance & Reproducibility Controls" as Layer6
database "Layer 7:\nData Stores Layer" as Layer7

' 参与者首先与请求接口交互，形成可执行的预测实验。
UPP --> Layer1 : provides requirements,\nsource data context,\nand feedback
TEAM --> Layer1 : configures and runs\nprototype experiments

' 主业务链路：请求进入编排层，经过数据处理和预测方法层，最后进入评估与交付层。
Layer1 --> Layer2 : reproducible\nexecution request
Layer2 --> Layer3 : orchestrates\npreprocessing workflow
Layer3 --> Layer4 : processed cohort-state\ndata
Layer4 --> Layer5 : forecasts for evaluation\nand handover

' 数据存储链路：多个层共同读写第 7 层的输入、中间产物、模型产物和输出。
Layer2 --> Layer7 : reads raw data and\nwrites run metadata
Layer3 --> Layer7 : writes processed\ncohort-term data
Layer4 --> Layer7 : reads/writes model\nartifacts
Layer5 --> Layer7 : writes forecasts,\nmetrics, charts,\nand reports

' 治理层是横切控制：约束执行上下文，支持溯源交付，并管理数据访问和输出用途。
Layer6 ..> Layer2 : constrains execution\ncontext
Layer6 ..> Layer5 : supports traceability\nand handover
Layer6 ..> Layer7 : governs data access\nand output use

@enduml
